{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 28, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "At first, it was just a feeling of déjà vu, a nagging sense that something wasn't quite right. But as John went about his morning routine, the anomalies piled up. The same bird sang the same song outside his window, the same barista made the same joke at the coffee shop, and the same commuter elbowed him on the train. It wasn't until he saw his coworker, Rachel, repeat the exact same line of dialogue for the third time that day, however, that the truth began to dawn on him: he was living in a video game.\n\n***\n\nThe realization sent John's mind reeling as he struggled to comprehend the boundaries of his new reality. He started experimenting, testing the limits of the world around him. He walked through a wall (and got stuck in an infinite loop of collision detection), tried to deviate from his usual route (only to be funneled back on track by \"coincidences\"), and even attempted to have an original conversation with Rachel (which ended with her glitching out and repeating her catchphrase for the fourth time). As the day drew to a close, John couldn't help but wonder: what was his purpose in this digital realm, and could he ever find a way to break free?", "logprobs": [{"token": "At", "logprob": -2.743091583251953}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -2.50339189733495e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": " it", "logprob": -0.06423263996839523}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -0.11332421749830246}, {"token": " just", "logprob": -0.010051113553345203}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0037111237179487944}, {"token": " feeling", "logprob": -1.1678577661514282}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.035478536039590836}, {"token": " déjà", "logprob": -0.016135817393660545}, {"token": " vu", "logprob": -5.769562994828448e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.3462634086608887}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.7766404151916504}, {"token":